SPAWN   | DRVS | $HOUSE/&.widgits/_shared-lib/ops/+x/game_core.+x | driver | $HOUSE | $T/s_adrv | $T/s_edit
WAIT_HAS | s_edit/state/game_ui.txt | gm_on=1 | 8000 | the-snake-setup-is-published
