RUN | $HOUSE/&.widgits/_shared-lib/ops/+x/game_core.+x | ctl | start | $T/s_edit/state/games/s_adrv
WAIT_HAS | s_edit/state/games/s_adrv/game/ledger.txt | bank\pstart | 8000 | the-game-starts-with-one-human-snake
WAIT_HAS | s_edit/state/game_ui.txt | gmb_0_label=Left | 4000 | the-four-steering-buttons-are-offered
APPEND  | s_edit/state/interact_relay.txt | 1003 100\n
