WRITE   | s_edit/state/world/switches.txt | running=1\n
WAIT_HAS | s_edit/state/games/s_adrv/game/ledger.txt | bank\pckpt\p | 8000 | the-ticks-run-and-a-ckpt-row-pins-the-state
APPEND  | s_edit/state/interact_relay.txt | 1002 200\n
WAIT_HAS | s_edit/state/games/s_adrv/game/ledger.txt | p1\pturn\pU\p | 8000 | AN-ARROW-KEY-LINE-APPENDED-TO-interact_relay.txt-TURNS-THE-HEAD-(up-1002-becomes-a-turn-U-row)
WRITE   | s_edit/state/world/switches.txt | running=0\n
SLEEP   | 700
RUN | grep | -c | -F | \pturn\pD\p | $T/s_edit/state/games/s_adrv/game/ledger.txt
EXPECT_OUT_IS | 0 | and-the-dropped-and-stale-down-arrows-never-became-rows
